-- Descriptions for the 300 bulk-generated, catalog-scale-testing products from V16
-- (ids 58-357) -- the remaining gap after V21 covered the 57 hand-curated products.
-- Books (172-209) are real published titles, described individually from their actual
-- content. The other categories are template-generated names (adjective + noun, e.g.
-- "Dual-Band Earbuds") -- each description is built from a genuine, concrete fact about
-- that noun (capacity, material, mechanism) plus what the specific adjective actually
-- means for it, not a single reused sentence copy-pasted across the row.

